      438.76
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, LakshmanYapa Abeywardana, Acting Minister of Finance of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order imposein respect of the commodity items specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy, at the ratesspecified in the corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule. This Order shall be valid for a period of 04 monthscommencing from 9th October 2015, subject to provisions of Sub section (3) of Section 2 of the Special CommodityLevy Act, No. 48 of 2007.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
